# Package manager: Bun

This project uses **Bun**, not npm or yarn.

- Install dependencies: `bun install`
- Add a package: `bun add <pkg>` / `bun add -d <pkg>`
- Run scripts: `bun run <script>` or `bun <script>` (e.g. `bun dev`, `bun test`)
- Execute binaries: `bunx <cmd>` instead of `npx`

Never use `npm`, `npx`, `yarn`, or `pnpm` unless the user explicitly asks.
